# Data artifacts — pmtiles and duckdb are committed as pre-built artifacts,
# EXCEPT the basemap: it's ~450MB (full OpenMapTiles-schema vector basemap,
# planetiler output), far past GitHub's 100MB file limit. Regenerate with
# `make basemap` (see pipeline/README.md) — CI must build it at deploy time.
frontend/src/data/*.tif
frontend/src/data/*.TIF
frontend/src/data/*.SAFE/
